  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Banking &amp; Financial Services - Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to assist the SBS in developing and maintaining a fair, safe, and stable financial sector that benefits and protects financial sector participants while maintaining public confidence in the financial system. Project components will focus on: (1) development of a regulatory and supervisory framework that addresses foreign exchange market practices and prevention of market abuse; (2) development of a trade repository to register over-the-counter (OTC) derivatives; and (3) strengthened cybersecurity and technology supervisory tools</narrative>
  </description>
